%% Composite Pattern Class Diagram
%% Composes objects into tree structures to represent part-whole hierarchies

classDiagram
    class Component {
        <<interface>>
        +operation() void
        +add(Component) void
        +remove(Component) void
        +getChild(int) Component
    }
    
    class Leaf {
        +operation() void
    }
    
    class Composite {
        -children List~Component~
        +operation() void
        +add(Component) void
        +remove(Component) void
        +getChild(int) Component
    }
    
    class Client {
        +main() void
    }
    
    Component <|.. Leaf
    Component <|.. Composite
    Composite o--> Component : contains
    Client --> Component : uses
    
    note for Composite "Stores child components.\noperation() iterates over\nchildren and calls their\noperation() methods."
